{"summary":"Build the ultimate bowl to leap past your\nramen rivals and achieve greatness!","description":"Build your ramen rep by fashioning the ultimate bowl from a vast assortment of noodles, soup, and toppings. From roast pork to miso, mackerel, and more--the only limit is your imagination, meaning you'll need to use your noodle to nail the right recipes and bring hungry customers in by the crowd!\n\nEnter contests and see how you size up against rivals, thus cementing your standing as superlative sensei of the savory! Succeed--and one day you might even have your own ramen theme park!\n\n--\n* All game progress is stored on your device. Save data cannot be transferred between devices, nor can it be restored after deleting or reinstalling the app.\n* Should the screen go dark and freeze, try to power your device down and relaunch the game.\n\nTry searching for \"Kairosoft\" to see all of our games, or visit us at https://kairopark.jp. Be sure to check out both our free-to-play and our paid games!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8NZ3d1S4xUY?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LhRIqG9iQY7jwvw1WPpfGVOydW8VHLzJ9sYUdOsz5XYfbSzyeyH-BKnsT2qlHpgvyNSzzUj3_XqgrOQZITFT-w","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aC8floH4-w8Q5iAVsZpGwEZHBocmjRdR7DuCd0uoZYuOlsCbEe_us2yDs6XJCwacAIlZHCl46ae7T9KtdcDQpvE","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2TQUHZq_rN0V76RxTtIou4kga4_kQjl47OsIJLb_iN2_dpB8W4FwmlDabZCjZB0kI5tl3uv2cUSXdMrMJoCr","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QvmZ6uFg8_rck2__5Wdds75FEkjFnGcv3j6S794GPISRO8VsFvmAeXInr7SeCQUM3Nf8qXo7VmXkfKO3JCvVvg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-cnlOe6u5W4DmUZhvY2AQSg3fEiLkWzVruNmJMFXZlFG6g-yt4Ct_SYdNHTENjcL3itUB3nfaeFADM7ZhC2kGA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pvs7affVBCztUTR4Xd5zFIro2PsFlD7qscmjxEK36brGQmySr_xghA1v8hNiF7_9t7h2dBRIcgGGQcIO1Wu30A","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xeU-C5eZIZ_iK_S2i1O